+// ---- the object the pass could not read: contained, named, and never certified (#651) ----
+
+/// A committed record whose bytes will not decode makes the reference set **incomplete**, and
+/// this pass then owes the operator three things at once: the report it *could* compute, the
+/// NAME of the record that stopped it, and a refusal to call the run clean.
+///
+/// The named-contents assertions live here rather than in the added discriminator
