+        "...and no loop resolves it: the repair loop cannot rebuild chunks it cannot enumerate, \
+         so this is the predicate `wyrd custodian --reconcile-after-restore` exits non-zero on \
+         (`crates/server/src/cli.rs`'s `restore_verdict`). A run that could not read part of the \
+         store must not come back 0: {report:?}"
+    );
