+            // the reference build (`gc::ReferenceSet::protects`), while this list is the UNION of
+            // that build and the verdict walk — two reads of the same records, an instant apart —
+            // so a record only the second could read leaves the gate open, and claiming "nothing
+            // was marked" over a non-zero count would print the contradiction on consecutive
+            // lines.
+            if report.stranded_marked == 0 {
